[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left side)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the control unit from its base and save it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035563.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the control unit\nis undamaged.</p><p>Connect the control unit to its base.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p>Check that the electric windows are working.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a>\n                                           (left\nside).</p>"]]